    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d21-a2">

                <pb facs="0129" n="23" xml:id="pg23"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 183.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Grant to Mr. Janowitz</hi>.</head>
                <p>Appear before the military commission as requested, show your passport, and
                    frankly state your case. If you are arrested or further disturbed, let me know
                    all the particulars.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grant</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >United States Minister</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
